                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#222222' fontname='Tableau Book'>The information provided, including any tools, services, strategies, methodologies and opinions, is expressed as of the date hereof and is subject to change. Delivery Hero SE and its affiliates (“DH Group”) assume no obligation to update or otherwise revise this report. The information presented in this report has been obtained from or based upon sources believed by the key personnel and specialists to be reliable, but DH Group does not represent or warrant its accuracy or completeness and is not responsible for losses or damages arising out of errors, omissions or changes or from the misuse of information presented in this report.</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#222222' fontname='Tableau Book'>Any and all information contained in this report is privileged and confidential and is to be treated as such and may not be reproduced, redistributed or disseminated, in whole or in part, by its recipients who have access to such information on a need-to-know basis and as part of their current function within the DH Group, without the prior written consent of the Management Board of Delivery Hero SE. Any unauthorized use is strictly prohibited.</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#222222' fontname='Tableau Book'>Please note that insider trading is a criminal offense and is prohibited pursuant to the relevant provisions of Reg. (EU) No. 596/2014. Kindly refrain from engaging directly or indirectly, into trading with shares or other financial instruments of Delivery Hero SE based on inside information you may have access to.  </run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#222222' fontname='Tableau Book'>If you are not the intended recipient of this report, please delete this e-mail and contact immediately </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#222222' fontname='Tableau Book'>jaime.fernandez@deliveryhero.com</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
