              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='7'>Local Stores includes all QCommerce types (including courier) apart from DMarts</run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='7'>MoM figures represent order growth in the last 28 days relative to the preceding 28 days </run>
              <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='7'>BM - Korea C2C orders are assigned under Restaurants Food MP</run>
